      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing subsection:\n“(2) In this Act, a reference to a fine includes a reference:\n(a) to a pecuniary penalty other than a pecuniary penalty imposed:\n(i) under Division 3 of Part XIII of the Customs Act 1901; or\n(ii) by a pecuniary penalty order made under the Proceeds of\nCrime Act 1987; or\n(iii) by a superannuation order made under the Australian Federal\nPolice Act 1979; or\n(iv) by a superannuation order made under the Crimes\n(Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989; or\n(b) to costs or other amounts ordered to be paid by offenders.”.\nArrangements with States, Australian Capital Territory, Northern\nTerritory and Norfolk Island",
      "skos:definition": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing subsection:\n“(2) In this Act, a reference to a fine includes a reference:\n(a) to a pecuniary penalty other than a pecuniary penalty imposed:\n(i) under Division 3 of Part XIII of the Customs Act 1901; or\n(ii) by a pecuniary penalty order made under the Proceeds of\nCrime Act 1987; or\n(iii) by a superannuation order made under the Australian Federal\nPolice Act 1979; or\n(iv) by a superannuation order made under the Crimes\n(Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989; or\n(b) to costs or other amounts ordered to be paid by offenders.”.\nArrangements with States, Australian Capital Territory, Northern\nTerritory and Norfolk Island",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ce5a9e7442b27366fb459410b278ae7b7f1dd6975ddbd12555aa2097f1b4babd",
      "skos:note": "Amends Section 3 of the Principal Act by adding a subsection that defines a reference to a fine."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Section 4",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing subsection:\n“(2) In this Act, a reference to a fine includes a reference:\n(a) to a pecuniary penalty other than a pecuniary penalty imposed:\n(i) under Division 3 of Part XIII of the Customs Act 1901; or\n(ii) by a pecuniary penalty order made under the Proceeds of\nCrime Act 1987; or\n(iii) by a superannuation order made under the Australian Federal\nPolice Act 1979; or\n(iv) by a superannuation order made under the Crimes\n(Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989; or\n(b) to costs or other amounts ordered to be paid by offenders.”.\nArrangements with States, Australian Capital Territory, Northern\nTerritory and Norfolk Island"
    },
