      "cml:premiseText": "the court convicting the person must not, unless in the opinion of the court there are exceptional circumstances that warrant it, pass a sentence of imprisonment for that offence or any of those offences.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The obligation overlaps with exceptional circumstances warranting imprisonment."
