      "values:originalText": "Section 20AC of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nsubsection (10) “an offence against the law of the Commonwealth” and\nsubstituting “a federal offence”.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 20AC of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nsubsection (10) “an offence against the law of the Commonwealth” and\nsubstituting “a federal offence”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
