      "cml:integrityHash": "b117922eee1b435b2c44edc4c6f303b788b47048d44191caea375d92a646457f",
      "skos:note": "Amends Section 20AC of the Principal Act to replace 'offence against the law of the Commonwealth' with 'federal offence'."
