      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "Section 85ZZJ of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsection:\n“(2) In this section:\n'employee’, in relation to a law enforcement agency, includes a person\nengaged as a consultant to, or to perform services for, the agency\nor a member of the agency.”.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 85ZZJ of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsection:\n“(2) In this section:\n'employee’, in relation to a law enforcement agency, includes a person\nengaged as a consultant to, or to perform services for, the agency\nor a member of the agency.”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-22-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b86507e20e455debddaab3c780d819521d3c8598f518bf39f01648263dd69a1a",
      "skos:note": "Defines employee for law enforcement agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-22",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22 Section 22",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "Section 85ZZJ of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsection:\n“(2) In this section:\n'employee’, in relation to a law enforcement agency, includes a person\nengaged as a consultant to, or to perform services for, the agency\nor a member of the agency.”."
