      "values:originalText": "(3) Where a sentence or order that has been passed or made under\nsubsection 20ab (1) of the Principal Act is in force immediately before the\ncommencing day, that sentence or order has effect, on and after that day,\nas if it had been passed or made under subsection 20AB (1) of the Principal\nAct as amended by this Act.\nSection 20B of the Principal Act to continue to apply for A.C.T. purposes\non and after commencing day",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Where a sentence or order that has been passed or made under\nsubsection 20ab (1) of the Principal Act is in force immediately before the\ncommencing day, that sentence or order has effect, on and after that day,\nas if it had been passed or made under subsection 20AB (1) of the Principal\nAct as amended by this Act.\nSection 20B of the Principal Act to continue to apply for A.C.T. purposes\non and after commencing day",
