      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "The Commonwealth Prisoners Act 1967 is repealed.\nLesser terms of imprisonment fixed under Commonwealth Prisoners Act\n1967 before commencing day\n'",
      "skos:definition": "The Commonwealth Prisoners Act 1967 is repealed.\nLesser terms of imprisonment fixed under Commonwealth Prisoners Act\n1967 before commencing day\n'",
