    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-35",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35 Section 35",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-35"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 18a, 21, 21 A, 21c, 22 and 23 of the Principal Act as\namended by this Act are relocated so that they appear in Part IA after\nsection 15 of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, and are renumbered\nas sections 15A, 15b, 15c, 15d, 15e and 15f respectively.\n(2) Section 21AA of the Principal Act as amended by this Act is\nrelocated so that it appears in Division 2 of Part IB after section 16b of the\nPrincipal Act as amended by this Act, and is renumbered as section 16ba.\n(3) A reference in a law of the Commonwealth or of a Territory, or in\nan instrument or document, to a section of the Principal Act that has been\nrenumbered under this section shall be read as a reference to that section\nas so renumbered.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 18a, 21, 21 A, 21c, 22 and 23 of the Principal Act as\namended by this Act are relocated so that they appear in Part IA after\nsection 15 of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, and are renumbered\nas sections 15A, 15b, 15c, 15d, 15e and 15f respectively.\n(2) Section 21AA of the Principal Act as amended by this Act is\nrelocated so that it appears in Division 2 of Part IB after section 16b of the\nPrincipal Act as amended by this Act, and is renumbered as section 16ba.\n(3) A reference in a law of the Commonwealth or of a Territory, or in\nan instrument or document, to a section of the Principal Act that has been\nrenumbered under this section shall be read as a reference to that section\nas so renumbered.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-35-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-35-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-35-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a7736b53cbccae8f91981d645339998fadbca4387744fb63a1293db3966b3ecb"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-35",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35 Section 35",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 18a, 21, 21 A, 21c, 22 and 23 of the Principal Act as\namended by this Act are relocated so that they appear in Part IA after\nsection 15 of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, and are renumbered\nas sections 15A, 15b, 15c, 15d, 15e and 15f respectively.\n(2) Section 21AA of the Principal Act as amended by this Act is\nrelocated so that it appears in Division 2 of Part IB after section 16b of the\nPrincipal Act as amended by this Act, and is renumbered as section 16ba.\n(3) A reference in a law of the Commonwealth or of a Territory, or in\nan instrument or document, to a section of the Principal Act that has been\nrenumbered under this section shall be read as a reference to that section\nas so renumbered."
    },
