    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Section 42",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "Section 19 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph\n(2) (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n“(b) the unverified signatory has given a verification statement or\nidentification reference and the account should not, as a result, be\nblocked; or”.\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 4, 1990\nForm of statement",
      "skos:definition": "Section 19 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph\n(2) (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n“(b) the unverified signatory has given a verification statement or\nidentification reference and the account should not, as a result, be\nblocked; or”.\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 4, 1990\nForm of statement",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6cbc6dcac858d7840a28c9a78da2d26419c05e3416e0c72a02fb6ae1a4ff1f56",
      "skos:note": "Account should not be blocked if unverified signatory provides verification statement or identification reference.",
      "dc:description": "Verification statement or identification reference"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-42",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 Section 42",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "Section 19 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph\n(2) (b) and substituting the following paragraph:\n“(b) the unverified signatory has given a verification statement or\nidentification reference and the account should not, as a result, be\nblocked; or”.\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2)\nNo. 4, 1990\nForm of statement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-42-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes a duty on the state to not block the account.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-43",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "43 Section 43",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-43"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.69",
      "values:originalText": "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from subsections (2) and (3) “subsection (4)” and\nsubstituting “this section”;\n(b) by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection:\n“(4a) A statement in relation to an account with a cash dealer\nneed not be accompanied by an identification reference for a\nsignatory to the account if the cash dealer has verified the identity\nof the signatory under subsection (8) in respect of another account\nwith the cash dealer.”;\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n“ (7) A statement in relation to an account with an identifying\ncash dealer need not be accompanied by an identification reference\nunder paragraph (2) (b) or (3) (b).\n“(8) Subject to subsection (9), where a statement of the kind\nmentioned in subsection (7) is not accompanied by an identification\nreference for a signatory to the account concerned, the cash dealer\nmust carry out the prescribed verification procedure for the purpose\nof identifying the signatory.\n“(9) Where a statement of the kind mentioned in subsection\n(7) is not accompanied by an identification reference for a signatory\nto the account concerned but an identification reference for that\nsignatory is subsequently given to the cash dealer, the cash dealer\nneed not carry out, or continue to carry out, the verification\nprocedure mentioned in subsection (8).”.\nIdentification references",
      "skos:definition": "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from subsections (2) and (3) “subsection (4)” and\nsubstituting “this section”;\n(b) by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection:\n“(4a) A statement in relation to an account with a cash dealer\nneed not be accompanied by an identification reference for a\nsignatory to the account if the cash dealer has verified the identity\nof the signatory under subsection (8) in respect of another account\nwith the cash dealer.”;\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n“ (7) A statement in relation to an account with an identifying\ncash dealer need not be accompanied by an identification reference\nunder paragraph (2) (b) or (3) (b).\n“(8) Subject to subsection (9), where a statement of the kind\nmentioned in subsection (7) is not accompanied by an identification\nreference for a signatory to the account concerned, the cash dealer\nmust carry out the prescribed verification procedure for the purpose\nof identifying the signatory.\n“(9) Where a statement of the kind mentioned in subsection\n(7) is not accompanied by an identification reference for a signatory\nto the account concerned but an identification reference for that\nsignatory is subsequently given to the cash dealer, the cash dealer\nneed not carry out, or continue to carry out, the verification\nprocedure mentioned in subsection (8).”.\nIdentification references",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-43-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-43-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6220a0683f1ad8bba1275f3d67f49f202eb03d254186c0216aa99b3a4c366081",
      "skos:note": "Amends Section 20 of the Principal Act regarding account statements and verification procedures."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-43",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43 Section 43",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 69,
      "values:originalText": "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from subsections (2) and (3) “subsection (4)” and\nsubstituting “this section”;\n(b) by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection:\n“(4a) A statement in relation to an account with a cash dealer\nneed not be accompanied by an identification reference for a\nsignatory to the account if the cash dealer has verified the identity\nof the signatory under subsection (8) in respect of another account\nwith the cash dealer.”;\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n“ (7) A statement in relation to an account with an identifying\ncash dealer need not be accompanied by an identification reference\nunder paragraph (2) (b) or (3) (b).\n“(8) Subject to subsection (9), where a statement of the kind\nmentioned in subsection (7) is not accompanied by an identification\nreference for a signatory to the account concerned, the cash dealer\nmust carry out the prescribed verification procedure for the purpose\nof identifying the signatory.\n“(9) Where a statement of the kind mentioned in subsection\n(7) is not accompanied by an identification reference for a signatory\nto the account concerned but an identification reference for that\nsignatory is subsequently given to the cash dealer, the cash dealer\nneed not carry out, or continue to carry out, the verification\nprocedure mentioned in subsection (8).”.\nIdentification references"
    },
