      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of subsection (14) the following word and\nparagraph:\nand (c) the Australian Securities Commission.”;\n(b) by omitting from paragraph (15) (f) “and”;\n(c) by adding at the end of subsection (15) the following paragraphs:\n“(h) a member or acting member of the Australian Securities\nCommission; and\n(j) a member of the staff of the Australian Securities\nCommission.”;\n(d) by adding at the end of subsection (16) “and to the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales”;\n(e) by omitting from paragraph (17) (b) “and”;\n(f) by adding at the end of subsection (17) the following paragraphs:\n“(d) the Chairperson or acting Chairperson of the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales;\n(e) a member or acting member of that Commission; and\n(f) a member of the staff of that Commission.”.\nFailure to provide information",
      "skos:definition": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of subsection (14) the following word and\nparagraph:\nand (c) the Australian Securities Commission.”;\n(b) by omitting from paragraph (15) (f) “and”;\n(c) by adding at the end of subsection (15) the following paragraphs:\n“(h) a member or acting member of the Australian Securities\nCommission; and\n(j) a member of the staff of the Australian Securities\nCommission.”;\n(d) by adding at the end of subsection (16) “and to the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales”;\n(e) by omitting from paragraph (17) (b) “and”;\n(f) by adding at the end of subsection (17) the following paragraphs:\n“(d) the Chairperson or acting Chairperson of the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales;\n(e) a member or acting member of that Commission; and\n(f) a member of the staff of that Commission.”.\nFailure to provide information",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-47-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-47-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b99beb2cc472bc86483c54d29caa0e4dd0ead053b6bc8207002a1efde690852e",
      "skos:note": "Failure to provide information",
      "dc:description": "Information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-47",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47 Section 47",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 71,
      "values:originalText": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by adding at the end of subsection (14) the following word and\nparagraph:\nand (c) the Australian Securities Commission.”;\n(b) by omitting from paragraph (15) (f) “and”;\n(c) by adding at the end of subsection (15) the following paragraphs:\n“(h) a member or acting member of the Australian Securities\nCommission; and\n(j) a member of the staff of the Australian Securities\nCommission.”;\n(d) by adding at the end of subsection (16) “and to the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales”;\n(e) by omitting from paragraph (17) (b) “and”;\n(f) by adding at the end of subsection (17) the following paragraphs:\n“(d) the Chairperson or acting Chairperson of the State Drug\nCrime Commission of New South Wales;\n(e) a member or acting member of that Commission; and\n(f) a member of the staff of that Commission.”.\nFailure to provide information"
    },
