      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "Section 28 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection\n(1) and substituting the following subsection:\n“(1) A cash dealer commits an offence against this section if the cash\ndealer refuses or fails:\n(a) to communicate information to the Director when and as required\nunder Part II or III; or\n(b) to comply with a notice under subsection 14a (1).”.\nFalse or misleading information",
      "skos:definition": "Section 28 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection\n(1) and substituting the following subsection:\n“(1) A cash dealer commits an offence against this section if the cash\ndealer refuses or fails:\n(a) to communicate information to the Director when and as required\nunder Part II or III; or\n(b) to comply with a notice under subsection 14a (1).”.\nFalse or misleading information",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-48-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-48-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "60f45da774e032bd513d07b939d61f48cc628897c94ceb95ca2e839a325cc2af",
      "skos:note": "Refusal or failure to communicate information and comply with notices is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-act#sec-48",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "48 Section 48",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 71,
      "values:originalText": "Section 28 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection\n(1) and substituting the following subsection:\n“(1) A cash dealer commits an offence against this section if the cash\ndealer refuses or fails:\n(a) to communicate information to the Director when and as required\nunder Part II or III; or\n(b) to comply with a notice under subsection 14a (1).”.\nFalse or misleading information"
    },
