      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "Section 29 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after\nparagraph (4) (a) the following paragraph:\n“(aa) misleading an identifying cash dealer in the carrying out of a\nverification procedure under subsection 20 (8);”.\nQuestioning and search powers",
      "skos:definition": "Section 29 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after\nparagraph (4) (a) the following paragraph:\n“(aa) misleading an identifying cash dealer in the carrying out of a\nverification procedure under subsection 20 (8);”.\nQuestioning and search powers",
      "cml:asserts": [
