      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52 After section 40 of the Principal Act the following section is inserted",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 73,
      "values:originalText": "in Part VI:\nConsultants\n“40a. (1) The Director may engage, under written agreements, persons\nhaving suitable qualifications and experience to perform services as consultants\nto the Agency.\n“(2) The terms and conditions of engagement of persons mentioned in\nsubsection (1) are such as the Director determines from time to time.”."
