      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 73,
      "values:originalText": "Amendment of Schedules by regulations\n“42a. The regulations may amend Schedule 1, 2, 3 or 4;\n(a) by varying or omitting any of the details referred to in the Schedule\nor any other matter contained in the Schedule; and\n(b) by inserting new details, or other matter, in the Schedule.”."
